## Step 24: Analyze Session Fixation

### Vulnerable Case

If:

```text id="j7m1kv"
Before Login PHPSESSID = 5f6194766020dcaa2c906358cbd2941b
After Login PHPSESSID = 5f6194766020dcaa2c906358cbd2941b
```

Observation:

* Same session ID remains after login.
* Session fixation vulnerability exists.

---

### Secure Case

If:

```text id="p9x4zn"
